   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">We invested $5 million in ARC Ride, a Kenyan e-mobility company pioneering a Battery-as-a-Service (BaaS) model for electric two-wheelers. The funding comes from our Climate Innovation Facility, a programme for accelerating climate innovation in emerging markets.The investment will enable ARC Ride to expand its battery swap network and scale local assembly of electric motorcycles. This will lower barriers to electric vehicle adoption, such as high upfront costs and range anxiety. Our investment supports Kenya&apos;s shift from petrol-powered motorcycles to electric alternatives, helping reduce emissions and improve air quality</narrative>
   </description>
